88:["$","p",null,{"children":["The Logic: We want to determine if setting the next bit ",["$","code",null,{"children":"r"}]," in our result ",["$","code",null,{"children":"q"}]," is\nvalid. Usually, checking if ",["$","code",null,{"children":"(q + r)² ≤ x"}]," requires squaring. However, the\nalgorithm uses a differential update trick: ",["$","code",null,{"children":"(q+r)² - q² = 2qr + r² = r(2q+r)"}]]}]
